<title>USA: Cisneros poised to announce departure - officials.</title>
<headline>Cisneros poised to announce departure - officials.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Housing Secretary Henry Cisneros was believed to be poised Thursday to announce that he will leave President Clinton's Cabinet, administration officials said.</p>
<p>Cisneros has long been expected to leave his position. Earlier Thursday he said he would decide shortly whether to stay on.</p>
